00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:10.490
This is a Creole cottage, a rather unusual one in that it's done in three parts.

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:13.230
And the color? That's pretty unusual.

00:20:13.390 --> 00:20:14.710
The red is gros rouge.

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:16.640
You mean from the French, big red?

00:20:16.840 --> 00:20:24.410
Right. It's a pretty powerful color, typical of the intense colors that you get from the Latin America and Caribbean influence in this part of Louisiana.

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:25.620
