00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:38.120
The alleyway was incorporated in the house to introduce light and air

00:20:38.120 --> 00:20:40.380
to make it more comfortable in this hot, humid climate.

00:20:40.820 --> 00:20:45.990
And how about the settling or the tilting of the transom up there?

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:50.480
For over 50 years, this portion of the house was used as a laundry,

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:54.250
and every day about 3 o'clock, they would empty the wash pots in the patio.

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:56.990
They would drain down the alleyway, and over that length of time,

00:20:57.090 --> 00:20:59.970
it inundated the foundation, and we had to do...

