One of my favorite houses and really important. It's called Madam John's Legacy. Well, who is

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:26.860
Madam John? Madam John was a character in a 19th century novel, and typical of New Orleans,

00:24:27.020 --> 00:24:29.940
the storyline got ahead of maybe what really history was.

