01:21:04.980 --> 01:21:08.200
Softening of the water is important because it means you use less soap,

01:21:08.720 --> 01:21:10.780
which is better for you because it's cheaper,

01:21:11.020 --> 01:21:14.040
but it also means that there's fewer nitrates that get into the sewer system.

01:21:14.880 --> 01:21:16.860
Now, lime is also used as a disinfectant,

01:21:17.190 --> 01:21:20.580
and finally, the lime acts to remove heavy metals,

01:21:20.700 --> 01:21:23.080
to precipitate heavy metals like lead and mercury.

01:21:26.120 --> 01:21:27.900
Now, this is really just a giant mixing tank.

01:21:28.460 --> 01:21:29.980
