01:21:48.720 --> 01:21:55.230
through those gates into a larger basin. Now with no more mixing going on, the sediment particles can

01:21:55.230 --> 01:21:58.600
drop out of solution and you can start to see a real improvement in the water.

01:22:00.700 --> 01:22:06.620
